{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the bright future of colonization with Cosmos Colonisation Corp\u2122! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are greeted by the planet Sandrax-66b! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s dusty. It\u2019s harsh. It\u2019s ours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have arrived on the frontline of exploring a new world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And although your ship has somewhat\u2026 stopped being a ship, that\u2019s no reason to despair. Cosmos Colonisation Corp\u2122 believes in you!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when we believe \u2014 even you will survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An open and fully destructible world </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you see can be taken apart, destroyed, or set on fire. Experiment. Test. Break engineering ethics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/52ac16276de501dd6a7ffcb53143f5b7.poster.avif?t=1759411091\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/52ac16276de501dd6a7ffcb53143f5b7.webm?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/52ac16276de501dd6a7ffcb53143f5b7.mp4?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Exploration of discoveries and anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown object? Mysterious signal? A melted door in the middle of the desert? Of course, it\u2019s safe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the horizons of corporate knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/408c8508709d19da8d7f0e507af283ac.poster.avif?t=1759411091\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/408c8508709d19da8d7f0e507af283ac.webm?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/408c8508709d19da8d7f0e507af283ac.mp4?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Daytime is for work. Nighttime is for survival.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While it\u2019s light \u2014 build, fortify, upgrade your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When darkness falls \u2014 prepare to face the locals. They\u2019re not inclined to negotiate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/0349b69b6ea75a9b76f6734f444771af.poster.avif?t=1759411091\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/0349b69b6ea75a9b76f6734f444771af.webm?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/0349b69b6ea75a9b76f6734f444771af.mp4?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical freedom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow orders. Or spectacularly break them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, attack head-on, unleash the Rot in the camp, or just burn everything down \u2014 Cosmos Colonisation Corp\u2122 supports any choice you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/e9680fb3afbac75beaacd32f5f34ceb9.poster.avif?t=1759411091\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/e9680fb3afbac75beaacd32f5f34ceb9.webm?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/e9680fb3afbac75beaacd32f5f34ceb9.mp4?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building and fortifications</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforms, walls, campfires. Build your dream shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything can be built. Everything can be lost. Especially if you forget to close the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/6eed0158dedc59af0ccc11cc8088c0e7.poster.avif?t=1759411091\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/6eed0158dedc59af0ccc11cc8088c0e7.webm?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/6eed0158dedc59af0ccc11cc8088c0e7.mp4?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress through disk modules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your experience is valuable! Save it on disks and enhance yourself and your equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmos Colonisation Corp\u2122 \u2014 Reliable solutions for unstable worlds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823970?t=1759411091","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/f29f32a195b1e68141befc5c3ca82c5cf1569b01/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759411091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/a704095321dac5d8e4b6c2cc64c34f32e333