sation Corp\u2122 supports any choice you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/e9680fb3afbac75beaacd32f5f34ceb9.poster.avif?t=1759411091\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/e9680fb3afbac75beaacd32f5f34ceb9.webm?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/e9680fb3afbac75beaacd32f5f34ceb9.mp4?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building and fortifications</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforms, walls, campfires. Build your dream shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything can be built. Everything can be lost. Especially if you forget to close the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/6eed0158dedc59af0ccc11cc8088c0e7.poster.avif?t=1759411091\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/6eed0158dedc59af0ccc11cc8088c0e7.webm?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823970/extras/6eed0158dedc59af0ccc11cc8088c0e7.mp4?t=1759411091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress through disk modules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your experience is valuable! Save it on disks and enhance yourself and your equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmos Colonisation Corp\u2122 \u2014 Reliable solutions for unstable worlds.</p>","developers":["2 Zombie Games"],